orac-branding (1.3.1-1) umbra; urgency=medium

  * Boot splash: a compact centred column like Shadowfetch's, instead of the
    full-screen picture and wide bar. A 320 px ORAC core emblem fading into
    black, the wordmark, smaller status dots and a slim 220 px gradient
    progress bar, with the boot message beneath. Nothing is scaled to the
    screen, so it stays tight at any resolution. The unused full-screen
    background and wide bar images are dropped.

